OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FNorth to
OL,6,Fnorthwest breezes pushing wintry
OL,7,Fshowers across the region, but few
OL,8,Foutbreaks reaching the southern end of
OL,9,Fthe Great Glen. Frost forming in
OL,10,Fcentral and southern areas towards
OL,11,Fdawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FCold. Spells of sunshine mixed
OL,14,Fwith, occasionally wintry, showers,
OL,15,Fthese most frequent from Inverness
OL,16,Fnorthwards and through the morning.
OL,17,FNortherly breezes turning to the
OL,18,Fsoutheast during the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
