OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FTuesday brings periods of rain and
OL,7,Fhill snow to the south. Wednesday
OL,8,Frather cloudy with some patchy
OL,9,Frain.Thursday frosty, dry and bright
OL,10,Fin south, with showers in north.
